WEBVTT

00:07:29.676 --> 00:07:31.596
it's in all things.

00:07:31.636 --> 00:07:35.636
It's in the landscapes,
it's in the elements.

00:07:35.636 --> 00:07:39.116
The Yolngu people
of northeast Arnhem Land,

00:07:39.116 --> 00:07:41.476
they have a Dreamtime story:

00:07:41.516 --> 00:07:43.636
Walu, the Sun woman.

00:07:44.436 --> 00:07:48.636
They say Walu lights
a small fire each morning,

00:07:48.676 --> 00:07:50.516
which creates the dawn.

00:07:51.196 --> 00:07:53.796
She then paints her body in red ochre.

00:07:53.836 --> 00:07:56.876
And as she does, some of it
falls onto the clouds,

00:07:56.916 --> 00:07:58.516
creating the sunrise.

00:07:59.236 --> 00:08:03.076
She then makes a torch
from a stringybark tree